@startuml
title C++23 GPU Datapath

component "Gpu1024" as GPU
component "GpuState" as STATE
component "control_memory" as CMEM
component "WideWord[8]" as VREGS

GPU --> STATE : owns
GPU --> CMEM : loads kernel
GPU --> VREGS : reads/writes vector values

note right of GPU
Dispatch is modelled as a small loop
over work-items with copy/add vector ops.
end note

@enduml
